<title>EGYPT: Medinet Nasr Q3 96/7 pre-tax at $25 mln.</title>
<headline>Medinet Nasr Q3 96/7 pre-tax at $25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which began on July 1, 1996 and ends on June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available)</p>
<p>					  July96-March97</p>
<p> Net sales				101,878,000</p>
<p> Operating costs			 19,105,000</p>
<p> Exceptional revenues		   4,297,000</p>
<p> Exceptional expenditure		  439,000</p>
<p> Net profit before tax		 86,631,000</p>
<p>Full company name is Medinet Nasr Housing and Development .</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
